             `stack_encrypt::op::Gte` implements `DefaultIndex<S>`
             `stack_encrypt::op::Lt` implements `DefaultIndex<S>`
             `stack_encrypt::op::Lte` implements `DefaultIndex<S>`
             `stack_encrypt::op::Matches<<DefaultMatch as stack_encrypt::op::MatchCase>::Case>` implements `DefaultIndex<S>`
